{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":464,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Ad Reward Boost"]}]},"\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Upon triumphing a match, an additional option to watch an ad for bonus rewards can appear. These are ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Ad Reward Boosts"]},"."]},"\n"]},"\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Mechanics"},"children":["Mechanics"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwCQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:AdRewardBoost.png"},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["After triumphing a match, there is a chance for an additional button next to ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Return to Lobby"]}," to appear. It is a green button with \"",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Watch an ad for 50 coins!"]},"\" written on it. This can happen on any platform. When pressed, an ad that is a few seconds long will appear."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The added reward is always ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coin"]}]}," ",{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["50"]}]},", regardless of the mode. Any modifiers present on the map will not increase the currency gotten. For example, a map with ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/All_Paths","title":"All Paths"},"children":["All Paths"]}," will not give ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coin"]}]}," ",{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["55"]}]}," upon watching the ad. Once the ad is finished, the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coin"]}]}," ",{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["50"]}]}," will be added to the triumph screen. This will also create two pop ups, one informing the player of them getting the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coin"]}]}," ",{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["50"]}]}," and another telling them that they redeemed the Enhance Reward ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Developer_Products","title":"Developer Products"},"children":["Developer Product"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ads that play will most of the time be Roblox advertisements, promoting commodities such as Roblox gift cards or other Roblox games."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwGQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Gallery"},"children":["Gallery"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwGg"},"children":["\n\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwHQ"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwHg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwHw"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwIg"},"children":["Video showcase"]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwJA"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwJQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:AdRewardBoostIcon.png","title":"Icon"},"children":["Icon"]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwKQ"},"children":["Icon"]}]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwLA"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"figure","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Category:Browse","title":"Category:Browse"},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]},{"type"